<title>BELGIUM: Belgium's Gevaert results Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Belgium's Gevaert results Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian holding company Gevaert will publish provisional 1996 results around Wednesday's close of trading on the Brussels bourse at 1530 GMT, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Generale Bank said in a research note it expected profit to show growth of more than 20 percent to 1.8 billion francs from 1995 due mainly to a strong rise in dividend income from Dutch insurer Aegon and the exceptional dividend paid last December by Belgian bank Dexia.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
